  "dct_description_sm": [
    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us7000qxcd](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us7000qxcd) Magnitude 5.9 earthquake at 84.495 depth occurred on Sep 19 2025 90 km E of Ozernovskiy, Russia. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 51.422 longitude 157.7944. It impacted 74 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
